DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
29230::$$$message_0210_0000_0000$$$::Huaaah...[lr]::
29231::$$$message_0210_0000_0001$$$::Today was tiring. It wasn't so different from other days, but today really took a lot out of me.[lr]::
29232::$$$message_0210_0000_0002$$$::I took a bath and brushed my teeth.[lr]::
29233::$$$message_0210_0000_0003$$$::I turned off the gas heater, plus I locked all the doors and windows. Okay, good.::
29234::$$$message_0210_0001_0000$$$::"Huh? Is Fuji-nee back yet?"[lr]::
29235::$$$message_0210_0001_0001$$$::I wouldn't want to lock her outside.[lr]::
29236::$$$message_0210_0001_0002$$$::...Oh right, she has a house key, and she wouldn't be careless enough to leave a door open if she already came home.::
29237::$$$message_0210_0002_0000$$$::I could walk her home... No, she's been riding a moped lately so I can't do that.[lr]::
29238::$$$message_0210_0002_0001$$$::Besides, the guys from the Group might come pick her up. They're more than capable enough.::
29239::$$$message_0210_0003_0000$$$::"Okay, time for bed..."[lr]::
29240::$$$message_0210_0003_0001$$$::Good night. I hope tomorrow's another good day...::
29241::$$$message_0210_0004_0000$$$::?[lr]::
29242::$$$message_0210_0004_0001$$$::What was that?[lr]::
29243::$$$message_0210_0004_0002$$$::A poltergeist?[lr]::
29244::$$$message_0210_0004_0003$$$::Does something that quirky live in this house?::
29245::$$$message_0210_0005_0000$$$::"DORYAAAAH!"[lr]::
29246::$$$message_0210_0005_0001$$$::Hurgblegh![lr]::
29247::$$$message_0210_0005_0002$$$::W-who's there!? They jumped me!::
29248::$$$message_0210_0006_0000$$$::"What are you sleeping there for, Shirou!?"[lr]::
29249::$$$message_0210_0006_0001$$$::"Ow! Was that you, Fuji-nee!?"::
29250::$$$message_0210_0007_0000$$$::"Ah-ha, did you think Saber would do this? Stop sniveling, Shirou. You look like a pizza that's been left out for three hours."[lr]::
29251::$$$message_0210_0007_0001$$$::"Gimme a break! Even Tohsaka wouldn't pull a knee drop on me while I'm still asleep! ...Wait, did you just get back?"[lr]::
29252::$$$message_0210_0007_0002$$$::"Yeah. The night's still young, you know."::
29253::$$$message_0210_0008_0000$$$::...The clock reads just before 10:00 PM.[lr]::
29254::$$$message_0210_0008_0001$$$::It's too wholesome to expect everyone to be in bed by now.[lr]::
29255::$$$message_0210_0008_0002$$$::At least one person will still be up until midnight.::
29256::$$$message_0210_0009_0000$$$::"Everyone's fast asleep. I'm bored."[lr]::
29257::$$$message_0210_0009_0001$$$::"Sakura's been busy with club, while Rider and Saber both need rest. We're all tired. Me too..."[lr]::
29258::$$$message_0210_0009_0002$$$::"Boooriiiinnng."::
29259::$$$message_0210_0010_0000$$$::...We have a difficult child here.[lr]::
29260::$$$message_0210_0010_0001$$$::I wish she would vent some of this chaotic spunk at school or at the kyudo club instead.::
29261::$$$message_0210_0011_0000$$$::"Wait, I guess you [font italic=true]are[font italic=false] Fuji-nee, because even if we were all here, it still wouldn't be enough for you to vent it all.[lr]::
29262::$$$message_0210_0011_0001$$$::Fine. Um, anyway just go home and go to sleep, Fuji-nee."[lr]::
29263::$$$message_0210_0011_0002$$$::"Mmm, [cacheimage storage=藤02e腕b(中)][wvl canskip=false time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=藤02e腕b(中) textoff=0]I will if you play with me."::
29264::$$$message_0210_0012_0000$$$::"Play what? Cards?"[lr]::
29265::$$$message_0210_0012_0001$$$::I'm sleepy, but not on the verge of passing out.[lr]::
29266::$$$message_0210_0012_0002$$$::A private late-night card game could be nostalgic, as well as somewhat lonely.::
29267::$$$message_0210_0013_0000$$$::"Mrgh, are you taunting me?"[lr]::
29268::$$$message_0210_0013_0001$$$::"I'm up for anything, but if it's just the two of us...maybe poker or speed."[lr]::
29269::$$$message_0210_0013_0002$$$::"Hmm... I think I have a chance at speed."[lr]::
29270::$$$message_0210_0013_0003$$$::"Yeah, you're not good at games like doubt."::
29271::$$$message_0210_0014_0000$$$::You can tell she's lying as soon as she plays a card.[lr]::
29272::$$$message_0210_0014_0001$$$::Tohsaka and Sakura are stronger than you'd expect at games like that. If I had to play one-on-one with either of them, I'd want to run, too.[lr]::
29273::$$$message_0210_0014_0002$$$::But anyway...::
29274::$$$message_0210_0015_0000$$$::"Hmm, I can't really get into this."[lr]::
29275::$$$message_0210_0015_0001$$$::"Yeah... It would be more exciting with Saber or Sakura around, but they're already asleep."[lr]::
29276::$$$message_0210_0015_0002$$$::It wouldn't be right to go and wake them now.[lr]::
29277::$$$message_0210_0015_0003$$$::But I don't want to say that to Fuji-nee's face when she's feeling lonely right now...::
29278::$$$message_0210_0016_0000$$$::"Y'know, it's been a long time since it was just the two of us. Why don't we have a chat?"[lr]::
29279::$$$message_0210_0016_0001$$$::"...Was there something you wanted to tell me?"[lr]::
29280::$$$message_0210_0016_0002$$$::"A lot, actually.[cacheimage storage=藤08e(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=藤08e(中) time=300 textoff=0] About your future and stuff, even though you keep avoiding it."::
29281::$$$message_0210_0017_0000$$$::Ah...that got me where it hurts.[lr]::
29282::$$$message_0210_0017_0001$$$::She's right. Fuji-nee worries about me in both public and private. I shouldn't shrug her off.::
29283::$$$message_0210_0018_0000$$$::"...All right. I figured we needed to have a proper talk about it, so we may as well now."[lr]::
29284::$$$message_0210_0018_0001$$$::"It would be hard to do in front of Sakura or Saber. And you wouldn't come if I called you to the Guidance Counseling office."[lr]::
29285::$$$message_0210_0018_0002$$$::"You've never even called me there... Fine."::
29286::$$$message_0210_0019_0000$$$::I get out of my futon and stand up.[lr]::
29287::$$$message_0210_0019_0001$$$::She looks up at me, puzzled.[lr]::
29288::$$$message_0210_0019_0002$$$::"Hm? What is it, Shirou?"[lr]::
29289::$$$message_0210_0019_0003$$$::"I'm going to go make tea. Is genmaicha fine with you?"[lr]::
29290::$$$message_0210_0019_0004$$$::"Okay! Make sure you get my teacup!"[lr]::
29291::$$$message_0210_0019_0005$$$::This could take a while, so it would be nice to have some tea on hand.::
29292::$$$message_0210_0020_0000$$$::Ah... Right, I already drained out the water in the teapot.[lr]::
29293::$$$message_0210_0020_0001$$$::I need to boil a new pot if I want to make tea.::
29294::$$$message_0210_0021_0000$$$::"I'll speed it up with the kettle..."[lr]::
29295::$$$message_0210_0021_0001$$$::I wanted to make the tea right away, but it's going to take longer than I thought. I feel bad making Fuji-nee wait.::
29296::$$$message_0210_0022_0000$$$::"...She was the one who suggested this. She won't blame me for making her wait a little."[lr]::
29297::$$$message_0210_0022_0001$$$::She also made her entrance tonight with a knee drop. I wish she'd come up with a better way to wake someone up.[lr]::
29298::$$$message_0210_0022_0002$$$::...Maybe that's asking too much. Fuji-nee has always been this way, and she always will be.::
29299::$$$message_0210_0023_0000$$$::"...Back then, I would've fought back."[lr]::
29300::$$$message_0210_0023_0001$$$::Then it would turn into a play fight, and I wouldn't forgive her until I got her into a submission hold and she tapped out.[lr]::
29301::$$$message_0210_0023_0002$$$::Back then, she was bigger than me, but now, I don't think it would be right to retaliate with my full strength.[lr]::
29302::$$$message_0210_0023_0003$$$::...No.[lr]::
29303::$$$message_0210_0023_0004$$$::For some reason, I actually don't feel like I'd win even though I'm taller now.::
29304::$$$message_0210_0024_0000$$$::The water boils while I'm thinking about Fuji-nee.[lr]::
29305::$$$message_0210_0024_0001$$$::I quickly prepare the genmaicha, then I pour it into Fuji-nee's cup, which has tigers on it, and mine.::
29306::$$$message_0210_0025_0000$$$::"Now to see if she actually waited for me or not."[lr]::
29307::$$$message_0210_0025_0001$$$::She might've snuck into Saber's room, which would save me some trouble, before causing a different scene.::
29308::$$$message_0210_0026_0000$$$::"Hey, Fuji-nee, I got the tea..."[lr]::
29309::$$$message_0210_0026_0001$$$::I stop talking halfway.[lr]::
29310::$$$message_0210_0026_0002$$$::Fuji-nee fell asleep while I was brewing the tea. She's making a face I would definitely expect from her in this type of situation while she lies on top of my futon.::
29311::$$$message_0210_0027_0000$$$::"...Haah."[lr]::
29312::$$$message_0210_0027_0001$$$::What a waste of tea.[lr]::
29313::$$$message_0210_0027_0002$$$::She crashed someone's room, said she wanted to talk, and then fell asleep as soon as I took my eyes off her.::
29314::$$$message_0210_0028_0000$$$::"...Good grief. My big sister sure is hopeless."[lr]::
29315::$$$message_0210_0028_0001$$$::I put the covers on her so she doesn't catch a chill.[lr]::
29316::$$$message_0210_0028_0002$$$::As for the teacups... I'll take them back and have some of this tea, too.::
29317::$$$message_0210_0029_0000$$$::Since my bedroom has been annexed, I'll just have to set up another futon somewhere in the living room and sleep there.::
29318::$$$message_0210_0030_0000$$$::"Mm...mm, Shirou... Mnyahmnyah..."[lr]::
29319::$$$message_0210_0030_0001$$$::She leisurely talks in her sleep.[lr]::
29320::$$$message_0210_0030_0002$$$::"...See ya. Good night, Fuji-nee."[lr]::
29321::$$$message_0210_0030_0003$$$::See you tomorrow.[lr]::
29322::$$$message_0210_0030_0004$$$::I hope you have some nostalgic dreams tonight.::
929278::$$$message_9210_0016_0000$$$::"Y'know, it's been a long time since it was just the two of us. Why don't we have a chat?"[r]::

